                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Olney to Mr. Manion.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-21"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Report on present situation of Hammond and other American citizens arrested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Olney.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
